# STEP 6: Configure Nginx

Inside the `nginx` folder, create:

`nginx.conf`

Write:

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;

    location / {
        default_type text/plain;
        return 200 "Welcome to Food Ordering Website!";
    }

    location /api {
        proxy_pass http://flask:5000/api;

        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
    }
}
```

### Explanation

**1. Listen on port 80**

```nginx
